":"Components are gathered by group or families. You can find all of theme in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/oudscomponents","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For exemple, in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"control","type":"text"}]},{"text":" family you will find ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"checkboxes"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"radio buttons","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"switch items","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and some ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"inputs"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" fields.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Layouts","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dividers"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"buttons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" are in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"actions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" group, "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"bullet lists","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"display","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" family."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"anchor":"Discover-main-components","title":"Discover main components"},{"stepsSection":[{"media":null,"caption":[],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"First, define the components groups we need as an enumeration. We will provide views for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"control","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" components, ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indicator","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components and "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"navigation","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components. The "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"enum","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" to define must conform to "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"CaseIterable","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"CustomStringConvertible","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"code":"tutorial-onboarding-3-4.swift","type":"step"},{"media":null,"caption":[],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then define a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CategorySelector"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": it must display a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsfilterchip\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for all ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"ComponentGroup","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" cases and keep a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"selected component group","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Binding","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":". Use the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"theme.spaces.fixedSmall","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" token for horizontal spacing between the chips.","type":"text"}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"code":"tutorial-onboarding-3-5.swift","type":"step"},{"media":null,"caption":[],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In the end, define the main view, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ComponentShowcase"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":". In the top of it, display a welcoming text with ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"heading large"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" typography and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"contentDefault"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" foreground color. Just below add the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CategorySelector"},{"text":" and pack them in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"text":" using a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"scaledMedium"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" spacing for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"vertical size class"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":". Apply ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"bgSecondary"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" background color to this ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Then add the views for components inside a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ZStack"},{"text":" and use the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"selected component group"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" to apply opacity on the suitable view.","type":"text"}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"code":"tutorial-onboarding-3-6.swift","type":"step"}],"contentSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some components can be used to define richer views. Let’s try to merge all the ones we have and provide a more interesting thing.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The aim here is display a big title, a pack of filter chips, and according to the selected chip one of the view we defined earlier.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"anchor":"Merge-components-in-a-richer-view","title":"Merge components in a richer view"},{"stepsSection":[{"media":null,"caption":[],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to apply a theme everywhere in your app, or on specific view, one special ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" is for you: the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudsthemeableview"},{"text":". This object will get a theme you instanciated and apply it as environment value. It will also instanciates some environment objects the components may need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Define a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":", add in its ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"body"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"text":" with an instance of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeTheme"},{"text":", and add inside your previously defined ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HomeScreen"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-onboarding-3-7.png","code":"tutorial-onboarding-3-7.swift","type":"step"},{"media":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can see how it looks like with other themes like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SoshTheme"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WireframeTheme"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeCompactTheme"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS provides ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" components like a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tab bar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":". The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"tab bar","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is quite particular: its rendering will change depending if Liquid Glass is applied (i.e. iOS 26+) or not (i.e. until iOS 18).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Add a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", with 3 items inside it: the ","type":"text"},{"code":"HomeScreen","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and two fake views.","type":"text"}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-onboarding-3-8-LiquidGlass.png","code":"tutorial-onboarding-3-8.swift","type":"step"}],"contentSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Now you master the components and the tokens, you can use ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" components and a specific view to inject your theme everywhere. Time to complete your first app!","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"anchor":"Navigations-and-themeable-view-a-step-further","title":"Navigations and themeable view, a step further"}],"kind":"tasks"},{"kind":"assessments","assessments":[{"content":[],"type":"multiple-choice","title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Which thing defines the theme to use everywhere?","type":"text"}]}],"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"}]}],"isCorrect":true,"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes! One view to rule them all!"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any other view"}]}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nope! You must ust the dedicated OUDS view to inject in subviews the theme"}]}]}]},{"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes, of course!","type":"text"}]}],"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Of course you can mix views from SwiftUI and OUDS"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":true},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No, not possible","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Feel free to mix components! If you have some bugs, submit us issues on GitHub ❤️","type":"text"}]}],"isCorrect":false}],"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Can you mix SwiftUI and OUDS components?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"multiple-choice","content":[]},{"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes, because OUDS is cohesive","type":"text"}]}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS iOS Swift Package provide some components with rendering depending to the OS (e.g. tab bars)","type":"text"}]}]},{"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Liquid Glass is applied on navigation elements like tab bar"}]}],"isCorrect":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No, Liquid Glass can be applied"}]}]}],"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components have all the same rendering whatever is the OS version"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"multiple-choice","content":[]}],"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding"},{"title":"Going further with more resources","abstract":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}],"action":{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"overridingTitle":"Get started","type":"reference"},"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","kind":"callToAction"}],"kind":"project","hierarchy":{"modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Check-Your-Understanding"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Define-information-cards","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view#Define-the-view-basics"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view#Check-Your-Understanding"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Components-showcases","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Discover-main-components"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Merge-components-in-a-richer-view"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Navigations-and-themeable-view-a-step-further"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Check-Your-Understanding"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further#More-resources"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further"}]}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Components-showcases"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Components showcase","category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","role":"project"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"tutorial-onboarding-3-6.swift":{"syntax":"swift","fileType":"swift","fileName":"ComponentShowcase.swift","content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","enum ComponentGroup: CaseIterable, CustomStringConvertible {","    case control, indicator, navigation","","    var description: String {","        switch self {","        case .control: \"Control\"","        case .indicator: \"Indicator\"","        case .navigation: \"Navigation\"","        }","    }","}","","struct CategorySelector: View {","","    @Binding var selectedComponentGroup: ComponentGroup","    @Environment(\\.theme) private var theme","    @Environment(\\.oudsHorizontalSizeClass) private var oudsHorizontalSizeClass","","    var body: some View {","        ScrollView(.horizontal, showsIndicators: false) {","            HStack(spacing: theme.spaces.fixedSmall) {","                ForEach(ComponentGroup.allCases, id: \\.self) { group in","                    OUDSFilterChip(text: group.description, selected: group == selectedComponentGroup) {","                        selectedComponentGroup = group","                    }","                }","            }","            .padding(.horizontal, theme.gridMargin(for: oudsHorizontalSizeClass))","        }","    }","}","","struct ComponentShowcase: View {","","    @State private var selectedComponentGroup: ComponentGroup = .control","    @Environment(\\.theme) private var theme","    @Environment(\\.oudsHorizontalSizeClass) private var oudsHorizontalSizeClass","    @Environment(\\.verticalSizeClass) private var verticalSizeClass","","    var body: some View {","        VStack(spacing: theme.spaces.fixedNone) {","            VStack(spacing: theme.spaces.scaledMedium.dimension(for: verticalSizeClass ?? .regular)) {","                Text(\"Explore some OUDS components\")","                    .frame(maxWidth: .infinity, alignment: .leading)","                    .headingLarge(theme)","                    .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","                    .padding(.horizontal, gridMargin)","","                CategorySelector(selectedComponentGroup: $selectedComponentGroup)","            }","            .padding(.vertical, gridMargin)","            .background(theme.colors.bgSecondary)","","            \/\/ Use opacity to reserve space vertically, otherwise height change when changing group","            ZStack {","                let controlOpacity = selectedComponentGroup == .control ? 1.0 : 0.0","                let indicatorOpacity = selectedComponentGroup == .indicator ? 1.0 : 0.0","                let navigationOpacity = selectedComponentGroup == .navigation ? 1.0 : 0.0","","                Control().opacity(controlOpacity)","                Indicator().opacity(indicatorOpacity)","                Navigation().opacity(navigationOpacity)","            }","            .padding(.all, gridMargin)","        }","    }","","    private var gridMargin: Double {","        theme.gridMargin(for: oudsHorizontalSizeClass)","    }","}","","#Preview {","    ScrollView {","        ComponentShowcase().orangePreview()","    }","}"],"type":"file","identifier":"tutorial-onboarding-3-6.swift","highlights":[]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view#Define-the-view-basics":{"abstract":[{"text":"Let’s suppose we want to define a view for corporate apps with headings, texts, buttons and images.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"How can we do that?","type":"text"}],"kind":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view#Define-the-view-basics","title":"Define the view basics","role":"pseudoSymbol","type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view#Define-the-view-basics"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)/Define-information-cards":{"abstract":[],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Define-information-cards","title":"Define information cards","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(onboarding)\/define-information-cards"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries":{"abstract":[{"text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms.","type":"text"}],"kind":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDST